- [ ] Install jsonwebtoken package
- [ ] Create authentication middleware
- [ ] Add token validation
- [ ] Implement token generation endpoint
- [ ] Add token refresh mechanism
- [ ] Add logout endpoint
- [ ] Update error messages (don't leak user existence)

