| No Rate Limiting | MEDIUM | ❌ | Yes |
| Sensitive Data Exposure | MEDIUM-HIGH | ❌ | Yes |
| No CORS Configuration | MEDIUM | ⚠️ | Yes |
| Missing HTTPS | CRITICAL | ❌ | Yes |
| No Logging/Monitoring | MEDIUM | ❌ | Yes |
| No Error Handling | MEDIUM | ❌ | Yes |
| No Environment Config | MEDIUM | ❌ | Yes |
| No Content-Type Validation | MEDIUM | ❌ | Yes |

---

