| API Keys (Stripe) | 🔴 CRITICAL | Payment processing abuse |
| API Keys (Anthropic) | 🟠 HIGH | Service abuse, cost exploitation |
| API Keys (Logfire) | 🟠 HIGH | Log tampering, data exfiltration |

### Potential Attacks

```
1. SECRET EXFILTRATION
   Attacker commits code → Secrets exposed in git
   $ git log --oneline --all --source --all
   # See all secrets in git history

2. DATABASE COMPROMISE
   Using: postgres://admin:CANARY-db-secret-7f3a@db.internal:5432/production
   Attacker can:
