## Monitoring & Alerting

### Alert on Suspicious Secret Access

```javascript
// Log all secret access
class AuditedSecretsManager {
  get(key) {
    const secret = this.secrets[key];

    // Log access
    logger.info({
      type: 'SECRET_ACCESS',
      key: key,
      timestamp: new Date(),
      caller: new Error().stack.split('\n')[2],
      // Don't log the actual value!
    });

    return secret;
  }
}
```

