| **Rotation Support** | ❌ Manual | ✅ Automatic |
| **Version History** | ❌ None | ✅ Available |
| **Production Ready** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes |
| **Development** | ✅ Convenient | ⚠️ Overkill |
