| **CORS** | ❌ Open | ✅ Whitelist | XSS prevented |
| **HTTPS Enforcement** | ❌ None | ✅ Yes | Data encrypted |
| **Payload Limits** | ❌ None | ✅ 10KB | Resource protected |

