DB_PASSWORD=your-actual-db-password
REDIS_URL=redis://:password@redis.com:6379
SENTRY_DSN=https://token@sentry.io/projectid

# Anyone with file access can read
$ strings /var/lib/app/.env
JWT_SECRET=your-actual-secret-key
```

**Missing Protection:**
- No encryption at rest
- No access controls
- No audit logging
- No key rotation

