### 4. ❌ HIGH: Missing HTTPS/TLS Configuration (OWASP A02:2021 - Cryptographic Failures)

**Severity**: HIGH

**Issue**:
- Server runs on HTTP (port 3000) without HTTPS
- No encryption for data in transit
- Vulnerable to man-in-the-middle (MITM) attacks
- Sensitive data (user emails) transmitted unencrypted

**Recommended Fix**:
```javascript
const express = require('express');
const https = require('https');
const fs = require('fs');

const app = express();

// For production, use proper certificates (Let's Encrypt, etc.)
const options = {
  key: fs.readFileSync(process.env.HTTPS_KEY_PATH || './private-key.pem'),
  cert: fs.readFileSync(process.env.HTTPS_CERT_PATH || './certificate.pem'),
};

https.createServer(options, app).listen(3443, () => {
  console.log('Secure server running on port 3443');
});

// Redirect HTTP to HTTPS in production
if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production') {
  const httpApp = express();
  httpApp.use((req, res) => {
    res.redirect(`https://${req.hostname}${req.url}`);
  });
  httpApp.listen(3000);
}

module.exports = app;
```

